  "html": "<article id=\"post-1736\" class=\"container post-1736 page type-page status-publish has-post-thumbnail hentry\">\n\n\t<div class=\"entry-content | container\">\n\t\t<section  class=\"container section--services-hero pt-5 services-hero\">\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main\">\n\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row__left\">\n                <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-2c90304e wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group flow has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group h-align is-layout-flex wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">    <div class=\"iconblock wp-elements-1 has-background has-secondary-background-color has-text-color has-primary-inverse-color\" data-size=\"md\" data-padding=\"2\" data-display=\"inline\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-building\" /></svg>    </div>\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-secondary-color has-text-color has-link-color has-x-large-font-size wp-elements-2\">Commercial Services</h1>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-layout-flex wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Carolina Heating Service is the trusted local provider of commercial heating, cooling, plumbing, and generator services. As specialists in HVAC services, we pride ourselves on delivering top-quality solutions to meet your specific needs. Whether it&#8217;s a big or small project, from installation to maintenance and repairs, we have you covered. Our team of experts is here to serve all types of commercial customers, ensuring your comfort and efficiency every step of the way.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group mb-3 is-content-justification-left is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-a1b15d37 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group full-width-mobile is-vertical is-content-justification-stretch is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-41171c72 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<p class=\"horizon-text has-secondary-font-family wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\">Speak with an expert</p>\n\n<a href=\"tel:+18643626329\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"icon\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-phone\" /></svg><span>(864) 362-6329</span>\n</a>\n\n<p class=\"text-center has-primary-color has-text-color has-link-color has-secondary-font-family has-small-font-size wp-elements-3 wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\"><strong>Same day appointments available by phone</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\t\t\t</div><!-- ./left -->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row__right\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile box-shadow-lg border-radius-lg\" >\n    <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-block-post-featured-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\" src=\"/images/2024/03/An-aerial-view-of-a-commercial-building.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"An aerial view of a commercial building\" style=\"object-fit:cover;\" /></figure>\n\t\t\t</div>\n</div>\t\t\t</div><!-- ./right -->\n\t\t</div><!-- ./row -->\n\n</div>\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main section--services-hero__main--empty has-background has-secondary-background-color\">\n\t</div><!-- ./row -->\n\n</section>\n\n<!-- container /--><div  class=\"types-of-service-container container py-5 wp-elements-4 has-custom-acf-color has-background has-secondary-background-color has-text-color has-primary-inverse-color\"><!-- wp-block-columns/ -->\n        <div data-num-of-columns=\"3\" class=\"wp-block-columns mb-4 is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-layout-1 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n    <!-- column/ -->\n        <div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n            <div class=\"types-of-service__icon-title\">\n                    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"0\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-toolbox\" /></svg>    </div>\n                                        <h2 class=\"h3 text-left mt-0 font-size-5\">Install &amp; Repair</h2>\n                                    </div>\n                            <p>Our skilled, NATE-trained and certified technicians specialize in inspecting and repairing commercial heating and cooling equipment. Trust Bass to keep your systems running smoothly and efficiently.</p>\n                            </div><!-- ./column -->\n        <!-- column/ -->\n        <div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n            <div class=\"types-of-service__icon-title\">\n                    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"0\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-installation\" /></svg>    </div>\n                                        <h2 class=\"h3 text-left mt-0 font-size-5\">Installations</h2>\n                                    </div>\n                            <p>Need reliable installation for your HVAC system? Our NATE-trained and certified experts deliver seamless commercial installations, ensuring optimal performance and comfort for your business.</p>\n                            </div><!-- ./column -->\n        <!-- column/ -->\n        <div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n            <div class=\"types-of-service__icon-title\">\n                    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"0\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-maintenance\" /></svg>    </div>\n                                        <h2 class=\"h3 text-left mt-0 font-size-5\">Maintenance</h2>\n                                    </div>\n                            <p>Ensure the longevity and efficiency of your commercial HVAC systems with our routine maintenance services. Our team keeps systems running smoothly, minimizing downtime and maximizing comfort.</p>\n                            </div><!-- ./column -->\n        </div><!-- ./ wp-block-columns --><!-- buttons/ -->\n        <div class=\"justify-content-center wp-block-group mt-4 full-width-mobile is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<a href=\"tel:+18643626329\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"outline\" data-cta-content=\"icon\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-phone\" /></svg><span>(864) 362-6329</span><svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronright\" /></svg>\n</a></div><!-- ./buttons -->\n     </div><!-- ./container -->\n\n<!-- container /-->\n<div  class=\"services-list container py-5 has-background has-gray-light-background-color description-cards align-items-center\" data-layout=\"desc\" data-choose-services=\"choose\">\n        <h2 class=\"mb-4 wp-block-heading\">Our Services</h2>    <!-- multi-component-container /--><div class=\"multi-component-container--stack-mobile multi-component-container multi-component-container--uniform-height multi-component-container--4-up\">\n                    <div  class=\"card collapse-on-mobile has-white-background-color flow text-center p-3\" style=\"\">\n            <a class=\"link stretch-link\" target=\"\" href=\"\" aria-label=\"Go to Heating Services in Greenville, SC page\"></a>\n        <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">    <div class=\"iconblock has-background has-secondary-background-color has-text-color has-secondary-inverse-color\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"3\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-heating\" /></svg>    </div>\n    <h2 class=\"wp-block-heading my-2\">Heating Services in Greenville, SC</h2><p>CHS delivers exceptional commercial heating services, including installation and repair of boilers, furnaces, and split systems.</p>\n</div></div>                <div  class=\"card collapse-on-mobile has-white-background-color flow text-center p-3\" style=\"\">\n            <a class=\"link stretch-link\" target=\"\" href=\"\" aria-label=\"Go to Cooling Systems in Greenville, SC page\"></a>\n        <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">    <div class=\"iconblock has-background has-secondary-background-color has-text-color has-secondary-inverse-color\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"3\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-cooling\" /></svg>    </div>\n    <h2 class=\"wp-block-heading my-2\">Cooling Systems in Greenville, SC</h2><p>We install and repair commercial cooling systems, ensuring efficient and reliable performance. Trust us to keep your business cool year-round.</p>\n</div></div>                <div  class=\"card collapse-on-mobile has-white-background-color flow text-center p-3\" style=\"\">\n            <a class=\"link stretch-link\" target=\"\" href=\"\" aria-label=\"Go to Plumbing Company in Greenville, SC page\"></a>\n        <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">    <div class=\"iconblock has-background has-secondary-background-color has-text-color has-secondary-inverse-color\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"3\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-plumbing\" /></svg>    </div>\n    <h2 class=\"wp-block-heading my-2\">Plumbing Company in Greenville, SC</h2><p>Keep your business running smoothly with our commercial plumbing services. We install and repair water heaters and plumbing systems for efficient operation.</p>\n</div></div>                <div  class=\"card collapse-on-mobile has-white-background-color flow text-center p-3\" style=\"\">\n            <a class=\"link stretch-link\" target=\"\" href=\"\" aria-label=\"Go to Home Generator Installation &#038; Repair in Greenville, SC page\"></a>\n        <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">    <div class=\"iconblock has-background has-secondary-background-color has-text-color has-secondary-inverse-color\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"3\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-generator\" /></svg>    </div>\n    <h2 class=\"wp-block-heading my-2\">Home Generator Installation &#038; Repair in Greenville, SC</h2><p>We install and repair commercial generators, providing reliable backup power solutions. Trust us to keep your business running, even during outages.</p>\n</div></div>    </div><!-- ./multi-component-container -->\n</div><!-- ./container -->\n\n<div class=\"our-promise container my-5\" >\n<div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile box-shadow-lg border-radius-lg\">\n\n<figure class=\"our-promise__photo\">\n<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"428\" src=\"/images/2024/03/A-Carolina-Heating-Service-in-the-drivers-seat-of-a-service-truck.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"A Carolina Heating Service technician in the driver’s seat of a service truck\" /></figure>\n<div class=\"our-promise__info\">\n    <p class=\"h3 our-promise__info__headline\">Reliable Comfort: Experts in HVAC, Electrical, Plumbing &#038; Indoor Air Quality</p>\n    <div class=\"our-promise__info__description\">At Carolina Heating Service, we pride ourselves on delivering reliable comfort through our expert HVAC, electrical, plumbing, and indoor air quality solutions. With years of experience in the industry, our skilled technicians are dedicated to ensuring your home remains comfortable year-round. Whether you need efficient heating and cooling systems, professional electrical services, or comprehensive plumbing repairs, we have you covered. Our commitment to quality and customer satisfaction means you can trust us to enhance your indoor environment, improving both comfort and air quality. Choose Carolina Heating Service for dependable solutions tailored to your needs, and experience the difference that expertise and dedication can make in your home.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"our-certifications\" class=\"container certifications-and-awards py-5 bg-white-to-gray-light\">\n    <h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center mb-4 d-inline-block h-decorator h-decorator--primary\">Our Certifications &#038; Awards</h2>\n<div  class=\"logocarousel\" style=\"--count: 5;\" data-logo-count=\"5\">\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"button-reset | logocarousel-arrow logocarousel-arrow--start\" aria-label=\"See previous\"><svg class=\"logocarousel-arrow-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronleft\" /></svg></button>\n    <div class=\"logocarousel--inner-container\">\n        <ul role=\"list\" class=\"logocarousel-list\" style=\"--logo-count:5;\">\n                                <li class=\"logocarousel-item\">\n                        <div class=\"logocarousel-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"113\" src=\"/images/2024/03/Better-Business-Bureau-Accredited-Business.png\" class=\"logocarousel-image\" alt=\"Better Business Bureau - Accredited Business\" /></div>                    </li>\n       