v>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading mt-3\">No matter the industry or scale we have you covered!</h2>\n\n<ul class=\"mb-3 wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Commercial Spaces:</strong> Offices, mixed-use, government, and retail</li>\n\n<li><strong>Food Service:</strong> Restaurants, ensuring optimal kitchen environments</li>\n\n<li><strong>Specialized Areas:</strong> Server rooms, guaranteeing precise climate control</li>\n\n<li><strong>Healthcare:</strong> Critical HVAC and generator services for medical facilities, maintaining sterile environments and patient comfort</li>\n\n<li><strong>Warehouse Solutions:</strong> Heaters and systems for efficient temperature regulation</li>\n\n<li><strong>Pre/Post-build:</strong> Comprehensive HVAC, plumbing, and generator solutions for construction projects at any stage</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"our-community\" class=\"container splitter mobile-flip-splitter has-background has-white-background-color\" style=\"--CTX-container-split-size: 0.5\">\n\n<div  class=\"splitter-column splitter-column--left splitter-column--center splitter-column--padded-edge\">\n    <div class=\"splitter-column-inner splitter-column-inner--contained splitter-column-inner--padded\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group flow has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\"><div class=\"wp-block-site-logo\"><a href=\"/\" class=\"custom-logo-link\" rel=\"home\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"122\" src=\"/images/2024/08/Carolina-Heating_Logo-NearU-1-1.png\" class=\"custom-logo\" alt=\"Carolina Heating Service Logo\" /></a></div>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading h-decorator h-decorator--primary has-secondary-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-8\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:600\">Serving the communities in Greenville, South Carolina, for over 40 Years.</h2>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Carolina Heating Service is known for reputable home comfort 